; Piccolo's chapter (docs/story.md section 0 item 4, section 4c), applied by ch4_piccolo.json. Player 1
; Piccolo, player 2 Hercule (bound since the landing; the save pad keeps the others). Android 13 (sprite
; 165, speaker 0: no portrait) backs Dr. Gero up in all three of Gero's stages (bosses.c: stat 7 pairs
; with 13, stat 112, both-down) and flies off after each; in the lab he watches 17 and 18 turn on Gero
; and leaves. The road: in co-op Vegeta arrives and is player 2 for the fight against 18 and her twin 17
; (bosses.c: stat 4's partner model is 17's, sprite 9), then player 2 is Hercule again.
; Speakers: 0 narration, 3 Piccolo, 4 Vegeta, 28 Android 17, 29 Android 18, 32 Dr. Gero, 67 Hercule.

; ---- zone 8 area 13: Gero's first stage ("You're trying to find my secret lab") ---------------------

; Staging (Ryan, 2026-11-05: "account for 1 player or 2 player or what the combination of characters could be"; "dont have them stagnant"). The chapter's
; selectable characters are Piccolo, Hercule and Krillin, in either player's hands. Only who is played is there (Ryan, 2026-11-05, after playing
; alone as Piccolo: "that doesnt make sense"; docs/howto.md "Stage a scene" rule 2): no actor of Piccolo or Hercule walks in; a line of one
; nobody plays is skipped (CoopCall 22 op 4: 1 = played) and the lines that answer it are reworded with it. Only 13, Gero and player 1 are moved:
; player 2 may show any sprite, and a sprite-addressed step on a sprite nobody shows writes through a null pointer (docs/scripts.md). 13 comes in
; on foot or by air to the spot his boss twin takes (TWIN_OFFSET right of Gero), so the swap does not show.
; Lines marked (draft) are Claude's, for Ryan to read.

sequence ch4_gero_first
  [0] script                             ; stock entry 0, with 13 walking down beside Gero and player 1 walking up
        PlayAudio 50
        SetStoryFlag 90
        SpawnCharacterEntity 165, 216, 168
        BeginCommandBatch
        WalkToPosition 14, 192, 240
        WalkToPosition 165, 216, 240
        WalkToPosition 0, 192, 280
        CommitCommandBatch
        SetEntityFacing 0, 1
        SetEntityFacing 165, 0
        END
  [1] stock @083d5ddc                    ; Gero: you'll never get inside!
  [2] text 169 "ANDROID 13: Remember me?\x0bThe Doc's got me on guard duty.  Nobody gets near that lab while I'm around!"
  [3] script                             ; Hercule answers only when someone plays him (next 4), else 5
        CoopCall 22, 4, 5, 0
        JumpIfFalse a
        PushByte 4
        END
      a:
        PushByte 5
        END
  [4] text 67 "HERCULE: Y-yeah, we remember!\x0bNice seeing you again.  You can go now."
  [5] script                             ; stock entry 2: Gero (and 13, his boss twin) fight
        DespawnEntity 165
        DespawnCharacterAndRecordPosition 14, 1
        DrawBossHealthBarRange 14, 75, 100
        ClearCollisionRect 72, 0, 208, 24
        ClearCollisionRect 240, 568, 376, 592
end

; ---- zone 8 areas 27 and 40: the two generators at the lab door (Gero's second and third stages) -----
; Stock: entry 0 skips to the second-visit lines when the other generator's flag is set. The index it
; returns is absolute, so the sequences are restated with it moved. By who plays (Ryan, 2026-11-05): Hercule's offer and his "Run?"
; only when he is played, Piccolo's "Get behind me" only when both are; 13's answer without "Negotiate?" when Hercule is not there, and
; "scrap ya" for Hercule alone (drafts).

