; ---- zone 8 area 46, the lab door (item 0, broken by walking up to it): the stock 16 scene ---------------------------
; Vegeta, Trunks and Krillin arrive, the cut into the lab, Gero orders 17 and 18 at them, they open 16's chamber, and 17
; kills Gero ("scrap heap", entry 26). Ryan, 2026-11-06: the death is here, and only here, so 13's revenge comes here:
; he stands beside Gero from the cut in (entry 67), and after 17's blast he swears revenge, blasts them and flies north
; (68-78), then 17's "Now that that's taken care of..." (27). Stock indexes are kept: the added entries sit after the end.
; Lines are drafts. Sprites here: 9 Android 17, 11 Android 18, 14 Dr. Gero (despawned by entry 26), 165 Android 13.

