; 18 (or the pair) beaten: she gets up and blasts player 1; "Who's next?"; then the fight the stock hid in a two-second black fade (the
; cutscene pass, 2026-11-06, docs/cutscenes/batch1_ch1-4.md 4.6): silent, about fifteen seconds. A white cut puts the stage where the
; stock ending has it (the view at 152, 296; 18 at 224, 344; 16 by the roadside; 17 beside her: the fight's own twin when there is one,
; so the ending no longer has two of him). Vegeta answers: player 2's body with two players (Cine's body -1), alone his actor, gold
; (140), down from the sky. His power, an exchange with 18 that she walks through, her kick on his arm puts him on a knee, a second one
; drops him. Trunks and Gohan fly in: Trunks' sword stops on her arm, 17 is behind him; Gohan is kicked aside. Piccolo gets up (player
; 1's own body when he plays Piccolo, else Piccolo's actor arrives with Tien: the stock ending has him lying there in every lineup) and
; 17 puts him down; Tien is caught from behind. A second white cut swaps the fallen for the stock's own lying bodies (they fall near
; those spots), rebinds player 2 as the stock fade did and places him by the roadside, and the stock ending goes on: flags, party and
; who lies where are the stock's. No line is added.
